{"id":"4967c7da565ea201","group":"16","path":"16/16-df-context-extension.md","title":"df-context-extension","display":"df-context-extension","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Jacobs — Categorical Logic and Type Theory","book_abbrev":"16","chapter":"1","label":"16-df-context-extension","aliases":["16-df-context-extension","Context extension"],"display":"df-context-extension","depends_on":["[[16-df-dependent-type]]","[[16-df-dependent-term]]"],"source":"Corollary 10.4.6 p.615 (PDF635); set-family model p.625 (PDF645)","revision_date":"2026-10-16"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Jacobs — Categorical Logic and Type Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"16"},{"key":"chapter","html":"1"},{"key":"label","html":"16-df-context-extension"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>16-df-context-extension</span><span>Context extension</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-context-extension"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"093bd17785f1dbfc\" href=\"?note=093bd17785f1dbfc\" title=\"16-df-dependent-type\">16-df-dependent-type</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"c9cb3cc51e30a056\" href=\"?note=c9cb3cc51e30a056\" title=\"16-df-dependent-term\">16-df-dependent-term</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source","html":"Corollary 10.4.6 p.615 (PDF635); set-family model p.625 (PDF645)"},{"key":"revision_date","html":"2026-10-16"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma,\\Delta\\in\\mathcal U\">\\(\\Gamma,\\Delta\\in\\mathcal U\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"U\\in\\mathcal U\">\\(U\\in\\mathcal U\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A:\\Gamma\\to U\">\\(A:\\Gamma\\to U\\)</span> 为集合族，使用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"093bd17785f1dbfc\" href=\"?note=093bd17785f1dbfc\" title=\"16-df-dependent-type\">16-df-dependent-type</a> 的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ty}_U(\\Gamma)=U^\\Gamma\">\\(\\mathsf{Ty}_U(\\Gamma)=U^\\Gamma\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Tm}\">\\(\\mathsf{Tm}\\)</span> 采用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"c9cb3cc51e30a056\" href=\"?note=c9cb3cc51e30a056\" title=\"16-df-dependent-term\">16-df-dependent-term</a> 的截面约定。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f:\\Delta\\to\\Gamma\">\\(f:\\Delta\\to\\Gamma\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{pr}_2\">\\(\\operatorname{pr}_2\\)</span> 取有序对第二分量。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma.A,\\pi_A,A[f],v_A,\\langle f,t\\rangle\">\\(\\Gamma.A,\\pi_A,A[f],v_A,\\langle f,t\\rangle\\)</span> 和截面的重索引由下文构造；不把语法语境与其集合解释当作同一对象。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\Gamma.A&amp;\\coloneqq\\{(\\gamma,a)\\mid\\gamma\\in\\Gamma\\land a\\in A(\\gamma)\\},\\\\\n\\pi_A&amp;\\coloneqq((\\gamma,a)\\mapsto\\gamma):\\Gamma.A\\to\\Gamma,\\\\\nA[f]&amp;\\coloneqq A\\circ f,\\\\\nv_A&amp;\\coloneqq((\\gamma,a)\\mapsto((\\gamma,a),a))\\in\\mathsf{Tm}(\\Gamma.A,A[\\pi_A]),\\\\\ns[f]&amp;\\coloneqq(\\delta\\mapsto(\\delta,\\operatorname{pr}_2(s(f(\\delta)))))\n\\quad(s\\in\\mathsf{Tm}(\\Gamma,A)),\\\\\n\\langle f,t\\rangle&amp;\\coloneqq(\\delta\\mapsto(f(\\delta),\\operatorname{pr}_2(t(\\delta))))\n\\quad(t\\in\\mathsf{Tm}(\\Delta,A[f])).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\Gamma.A&amp;\\coloneqq\\{(\\gamma,a)\\mid\\gamma\\in\\Gamma\\land a\\in A(\\gamma)\\},\\\\\n\\pi_A&amp;\\coloneqq((\\gamma,a)\\mapsto\\gamma):\\Gamma.A\\to\\Gamma,\\\\\nA[f]&amp;\\coloneqq A\\circ f,\\\\\nv_A&amp;\\coloneqq((\\gamma,a)\\mapsto((\\gamma,a),a))\\in\\mathsf{Tm}(\\Gamma.A,A[\\pi_A]),\\\\\ns[f]&amp;\\coloneqq(\\delta\\mapsto(\\delta,\\operatorname{pr}_2(s(f(\\delta)))))\n\\quad(s\\in\\mathsf{Tm}(\\Gamma,A)),\\\\\n\\langle f,t\\rangle&amp;\\coloneqq(\\delta\\mapsto(f(\\delta),\\operatorname{pr}_2(t(\\delta))))\n\\quad(t\\in\\mathsf{Tm}(\\Delta,A[f])).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n(\\forall f:\\Delta\\to\\Gamma)(\\forall t\\in\\mathsf{Tm}(\\Delta,A[f]))\\quad\n&amp;\\pi_A\\circ\\langle f,t\\rangle=f\\ \\land\\ v_A[\\langle f,t\\rangle]=t\\\\\n&amp;\\land(\\forall h:\\Delta\\to\\Gamma.A)\\bigl(\n\\pi_Ah=f\\land v_A[h]=t\\Longrightarrow h=\\langle f,t\\rangle\\bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n(\\forall f:\\Delta\\to\\Gamma)(\\forall t\\in\\mathsf{Tm}(\\Delta,A[f]))\\quad\n&amp;\\pi_A\\circ\\langle f,t\\rangle=f\\ \\land\\ v_A[\\langle f,t\\rangle]=t\\\\\n&amp;\\land(\\forall h:\\Delta\\to\\Gamma.A)\\bigl(\n\\pi_Ah=f\\land v_A[h]=t\\Longrightarrow h=\\langle f,t\\rangle\\bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>这是集合族模型中的语境扩展。泛项必须是 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A[\\pi_A]\">\\(A[\\pi_A]\\)</span> 的截面，其值为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"((\\gamma,a),a)\">\\(((\\gamma,a),a)\\)</span>；旧式 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"v_A(\\gamma,a)=a\">\\(v_A(\\gamma,a)=a\\)</span> 只是值分量，与本目录截面约定不符。配对及唯一性逐点由有序对的两个分量确定。来源：Corollary 10.4.6 p.615（PDF635）、§10.5 p.625（PDF645）。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"16-df-dependent-type","status":"resolved","id":"093bd17785f1dbfc","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[16-df-dependent-type]]","embed":false},{"target":"16-df-dependent-term","status":"resolved","id":"c9cb3cc51e30a056","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[16-df-dependent-term]]","embed":false},{"target":"16-df-dependent-type","status":"resolved","id":"093bd17785f1dbfc","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\Gamma,\\Delta\\in\\mathcal U$、$U\\in\\mathcal U$、$A:\\Gamma\\to U$ 为集合族，使用 [[16-df-dependent-type]] 的 $\\mathsf{Ty}_U(\\Gamma)=U^\\Gamma$。$\\mathsf{Tm}$ 采用 [[16-df-dependent-term]] 的截面约定。","embed":false},{"target":"16-df-dependent-term","status":"resolved","id":"c9cb3cc51e30a056","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\Gamma,\\Delta\\in\\mathcal U$、$U\\in\\mathcal U$、$A:\\Gamma\\to U$ 为集合族，使用 [[16-df-dependent-type]] 的 $\\mathsf{Ty}_U(\\Gamma)=U^\\Gamma$。$\\mathsf{Tm}$ 采用 [[16-df-dependent-term]] 的截面约定。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\Gamma,\\Delta\\in\\mathcal U","display":false},{"tex":"U\\in\\mathcal U","display":false},{"tex":"A:\\Gamma\\to U","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathsf{Ty}_U(\\Gamma)=U^\\Gamma","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathsf{Tm}","display":false},{"tex":"f:\\Delta\\to\\Gamma","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{pr}_2","display":false},{"tex":"\\Gamma.A,\\pi_A,A[f],v_A,\\langle f,t\\rangle","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\Gamma.A&\\coloneqq\\{(\\gamma,a)\\mid\\gamma\\in\\Gamma\\land a\\in A(\\gamma)\\},\\\\\n\\pi_A&\\coloneqq((\\gamma,a)\\mapsto\\gamma):\\Gamma.A\\to\\Gamma,\\\\\nA[f]&\\coloneqq A\\circ f,\\\\\nv_A&\\coloneqq((\\gamma,a)\\mapsto((\\gamma,a),a))\\in\\mathsf{Tm}(\\Gamma.A,A[\\pi_A]),\\\\\ns[f]&\\coloneqq(\\delta\\mapsto(\\delta,\\operatorname{pr}_2(s(f(\\delta)))))\n\\quad(s\\in\\mathsf{Tm}(\\Gamma,A)),\\\\\n\\langle f,t\\rangle&\\coloneqq(\\delta\\mapsto(f(\\delta),\\operatorname{pr}_2(t(\\delta))))\n\\quad(t\\in\\mathsf{Tm}(\\Delta,A[f])).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n(\\forall f:\\Delta\\to\\Gamma)(\\forall t\\in\\mathsf{Tm}(\\Delta,A[f]))\\quad\n&\\pi_A\\circ\\langle f,t\\rangle=f\\ \\land\\ v_A[\\langle f,t\\rangle]=t\\\\\n&\\land(\\forall h:\\Delta\\to\\Gamma.A)\\bigl(\n\\pi_Ah=f\\land v_A[h]=t\\Longrightarrow h=\\langle f,t\\rangle\\bigr).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"A[\\pi_A]","display":false},{"tex":"((\\gamma,a),a)","display":false},{"tex":"v_A(\\gamma,a)=a","display":false}],"bytes":2027,"backlinks":[{"id":"02989c2f6135149f","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\Gamma,U,A$ 满足 [[16-df-context-extension]] 的集合族条件；$\\Gamma.A$、$\\pi_A$ 和泛项采用该文件的完整构造。"},{"id":"1bdcb9b14f83cac1","anchor":"ref-162","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[16-df-context-extension|df-context-extension]]"}],"outgoing":["093bd17785f1dbfc","c9cb3cc51e30a056"]}